    },
    {
      "id": "article-beliefs-zh-1440.015",
      "kind": "text",
      "paint_order": 15,
      "x": 287,
      "y": 220,
      "width": 905,
      "font_family": "Noto Serif CJK SC",
      "font_size": 64,
      "font_style": "normal",
      "line_height": 69,
      "letter_spacing": 0,
      "color": "#171c19",
      "lines": [
        "你发送的文字，",
        "不总是你的信念。"
      ],
      "copy_id": "copy-2b6229724706",
      "role": "text",
      "anchor": "start"
    },
    {
      "id": "article-beliefs-zh-1440.016",
      "kind": "text",
      "paint_order": 16,
      "x": 287,
      "y": 392,
      "width": 784,
      "font_family": "Noto Sans CJK SC",
      "font_size": 22,
      "font_style": "normal",
      "line_height": 36.3,
      "letter_spacing": 0,
      "color": "#616969",
      "lines": [
        "一份谨慎的档案，不能只看发送者标签。"
      ],
      "copy_id": "copy-4ce393ffb42a",
      "role": "text",
      "anchor": "start"
    },
    {
      "id": "article-beliefs-zh-1440.017",
      "kind": "text",
      "paint_order": 17,
      "x": 287,
      "y": 466,
      "width": null,
      "font_family": "Noto Sans CJK SC",
      "font_size": 11,
      "font_style": "normal",
      "line_height": 18.15,
      "letter_spacing": 0,
      "color": "#707975",
      "lines": [
        "PAIA · 待审阅的文章草稿"
      ],
      "copy_id": "copy-b6b352df7872",
      "role": "text",
      "anchor": "start"
    },
    {
      "id": "article-beliefs-zh-1440.018",
      "kind": "photograph",
      "paint_order": 18,
      "asset": "light",
      "x": 287,
      "y": 522,
      "width": 866,
      "height": 389,
      "rotation": -0.6,
      "crop_xywh": [
        0.0,
        663.11,
        1500.0,
        673.79
      ],
      "position": [
        0.5,
        0.5
      ],
      "arch": false
    },
    {
      "id": "article-beliefs-zh-1440.019",
      "kind": "text",
      "paint_order": 19,
      "x": 76,
      "y": 984,
      "width": null,
      "font_family": "Noto Sans CJK SC",
      "font_size": 9.5,
      "font_style": "normal",
      "line_height": 16,
      "letter_spacing": 2.4,
      "color": "#707975",
      "lines": [
        "关于",
        "连贯的一则手记。"
      ],
      "copy_id": "copy-55008bbb8201",
      "role": "decorative-annotation",
      "anchor": "start"
    },
    {
      "id": "article-beliefs-zh-1440.020",
      "kind": "text",
      "paint_order": 20,
      "x": 287,
      "y": 984,
      "width": 690,
      "font_family": "Noto Sans CJK SC",
      "font_size": 19,
      "font_style": "normal",
      "line_height": 32,
      "letter_spacing": 0,
      "color": "#37433b",
      "lines": [
        "设想你把岗位描述发给 AI，请它判断是否适合自己。那些文字出现在你的消息里，",
        "但雇主的要求不会因此变成你的志向。保存消息，记录的是一个事实；把每句话都",
        "转成你的偏好，则是另一个缺乏依据的动作。"
      ],
      "copy_id": "copy-22651461e9fe",
      "role": "text",
      "anchor": "start"
    },
    {
      "id": "article-beliefs-zh-1440.021",
      "kind": "text",
      "paint_order": 21,
      "x": 287,
      "y": 1111,
      "width": 690,
      "font_family": "Noto Sans CJK SC",
      "font_size": 19,
      "font_style": "normal",
      "line_height": 32,
      "letter_spacing": 0,
      "color": "#37433b",
      "lines": [
        "引文、反方论证、角色扮演、翻译和为别人写的草稿，都存在同样的问题。即使一",
        "句话完全由你自己写成，它也可能是假设，而不是结论。它的意义取决于当时正在",
        "探索的问题。"
      ],
      "copy_id": "copy-8b6e4e77bbbe",
      "role": "text",
      "anchor": "start"
    },
    {
      "id": "article-beliefs-zh-1440.022",
      "kind": "text",
      "paint_order": 22,
      "x": 287,
      "y": 1238,
      "width": 690,
      "font_family": "Noto Sans CJK SC",
      "font_size": 19,
      "font_style": "normal",
      "line_height": 32,
      "letter_spacing": 0,
      "color": "#37433b",
      "lines": [
        "因此，PAIA 区分原始表达与对表达的解释。来源可以告诉你当时发了什么，主题可",
        "以帮助聚合相关材料，AI 整理后的呈现也许更方便阅读。但它们都不应悄悄成为新",
        "的个人真值。"
      ],
      "copy_id": "copy-89c196ee50ff",
      "role": "text",
      "anchor": "start"
    },
    {
      "id": "article-beliefs-zh-1440.023",
      "kind": "line",
      "paint_order": 23,
      "x1": 287,
      "y1": 1385,
      "x2": 367,
      "y2": 1385,
      "stroke": "#a0a99e",
      "stroke_width": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "article-beliefs-zh-1440.024",
      "kind": "text",
      "paint_order": 24,
      "x": 287,
      "y": 1427,
      "width": 701,
      "font_family": "Noto Serif CJK SC",
      "font_size": 43,
      "font_style": "normal",
      "line_height": 51,
      "letter_spacing": 0,
      "color": "#171c19",
      "lines": [
        "真正有用的，",
        "可能是三句话，而不是三年。"
      ],
      "copy_id": "copy-82a5cd584e11",
      "role": "text",
      "anchor": "start"
    },
    {
      "id": "article-beliefs-zh-1440.025",
      "kind": "text",
      "paint_order": 25,
      "x": 287,
      "y": 1603,
      "width": 690,
      "font_family": "Noto Sans CJK SC",
      "font_size": 19,
      "font_style": "normal",
      "line_height": 32,
      "letter_spacing": 0,
      "color": "#37433b",
      "lines": [
        "好的整理应该给不确定性留下位置。你应当能查看证据、修改文字、排除某条内容",
        "，而不必对抗一个信心十足的个人叙事。“我正在考虑”不应该被改写成“我已经决",
        "定”。"
      ],
      "copy_id": "copy-8ebc58107c11",
      "role": "text",
      "anchor": "start"
    },
    {
      "id": "article-beliefs-zh-1440.026",
      "kind": "text",
      "paint_order": 26,
      "x": 287,
      "y": 1730,
      "width": 690,
      "font_family": "Noto Sans CJK SC",
      "font_size": 19,
      "font_style": "normal",
      "line_height": 32,
      "letter_spacing": 0,
      "color": "#37433b",
      "lines": [
        "当材料被再次使用时，这个区别尤其重要。新任务的上下文既需要相关性，也需要",
        "每段文字保持正确的角色。引用仍然是引用，旧计划可以被标明是旧计划，当前偏",
        "好则可以因为你明确确认而被选中。"
      ],
      "copy_id": "copy-1e3e94664980",
      "role": "text",
      "anchor": "start"
    },
    {
      "id": "article-beliefs-zh-1440.027",
      "kind": "text",
      "paint_order": 27,
      "x": 287,
      "y": 1857,
      "width": 690,
      "font_family": "Noto Sans CJK SC",
      "font_size": 19,
      "font_style": "normal",
      "line_height": 32,
      "letter_spacing": 0,
      "color": "#37433b",
      "lines": [
        "目的不是让档案畏首畏尾，而是让它值得信任、可以继续使用：结构有用，来源可",
        "见，而最后的判断仍然属于你。"
      ],
      "copy_id": "copy-6e66fd2b5e33",
      "role": "text",
      "anchor": "start"
    },
    {
      "id": "article-beliefs-zh-1440.028",
      "kind": "text",
      "paint_order": 28,
      "x": 287,
      "y": 1978,
      "width": 740,
      "font_family": "Noto Sans CJK SC",
      "font_size": 11,
      "font_style": "normal",
      "line_height": 18.15,
      "letter_spacing": 0,
      "color": "#707975",
      "lines": [
        "这是产品观点，不代表相关能力均已发布。"
      ],
      "copy_id": "copy-02dda9d1f87c",
      "role": "text",
      "anchor": "start"
    },
    {
